WEBVTT

00:00:28.777 --> 00:00:30.793
Oscar stepped outside for a break

00:00:30.817 --> 00:00:33.720
and looked up at the night sky
and he saw this.

00:00:34.103 --> 00:00:36.468
This is the Large Magellanic Cloud.

00:00:36.492 --> 00:00:40.199
It's a satellite galaxy very near
our own Milky Way.

00:00:40.223 --> 00:00:41.565
But on that February night,

00:00:41.589 --> 00:00:44.521
Oscar noticed that something
was different about this galaxy.

00:00:44.545 --> 00:00:46.109
It didn't quite look like this.

00:00:46.133 --> 00:00:48.365
It looked like this.

00:00:49.475 --> 00:00:50.641
Did you see it?

00:00:50.665 --> 00:00:51.698
(Laughter)

00:00:51.722 --> 00:00:56.863
A small point of light had appeared
in one corner of this galaxy.

00:00:57.327 --> 00:01:00.091
So to explain how amazing it is
that Oscar noticed this,